Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.32,0:00:21.52,Default,,0,0,0,,For this to work, what you need is\Nthe power of my stand, the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.60,0:00:25.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Beyond the powers my stand\Nshall bestow upon you lies the
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.58,0:00:28.99,Default,,0,0,0,,path you must travel in order\Nto find the gates of heaven.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.46,0:00:33.18,Default,,0,0,0,,What you will need once on the\Npath is a trustworthy friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.82,0:00:37.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Someone capable of controlling\Ntheir own selfish desires.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.14,0:00:43.26,Default,,0,0,0,,A person who shares no interest\Nin sex, fame, wealth, or power.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.68,0:00:44.66,Default,,0,0,0,,And above all,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.98,0:00:49.33,Default,,0,0,0,,they must be someone who chooses the\Nwill of God before the law of humans.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.98,0:00:54.80,Default,,0,0,0,,The question remains, will I ever cross\Npaths with someone like this one day?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.26,0:00:57.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Additionally,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.17,0:01:01.37,Default,,0,0,0,,you need the souls of more than 36\Nhumans who have committed atrocious sins.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.28,0:01:06.46,Default,,0,0,0,,That is because those who have\Nsinned harbor a strong power within.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.52,0:01:11.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Of equal note, there are 14\Nwords you need to keep in mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.88,0:01:14.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Their significance is vital to this plan,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.70,0:01:19.74,Default,,0,0,0,,so I will engrave them onto my stand to\Nensure that I never forget them myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.88,0:01:23.48,Default,,0,0,0,,What is most necessary is courage.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.56,0:01:28.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm loath to do so, but I must have the\Ncourage to relinquish my stand once.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.62,0:01:31.39,Default,,0,0,0,,As it gradually disintegrates,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.62,0:01:35.38,Default,,0,0,0,,my stand will take form and absorb\Nthe souls of the 36 sinners,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.68,0:01:38.44,Default,,0,0,0,,and will give birth to\Nsomething entirely new.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.80,0:01:40.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Whatever is born will awaken.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.94,0:01:47.29,Default,,0,0,0,,And once these 14 words are\Nuttered by my trusted friend,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.44,0:01:49.85,Default,,0,0,0,,the newborn will express a keen interest.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.70,0:02:00.62,Default,,0,0,0,,In this moment, my friend will trust\Nme as I befriend this new entity.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.80,0:02:04.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Lastly, you will need\Nan appropriate location.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.00,0:02:08.10,Default,,0,0,0,,North latitude, 28 degrees, 24 minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.76,0:02:11.56,Default,,0,0,0,,West longitude, 80 degrees, 36 minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.84,0:02:20.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Go there, and wait patiently\Nfor the next new moon.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.96,0:02:24.84,Default,,0,0,0,,That, my friend, is when heaven will come.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.76,0:02:29.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, hello there, Father.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.56,0:02:30.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Good morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.47,0:02:32.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Your hair has gotten longer.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.66,0:02:34.78,Default,,0,0,0,,How many days since your last visit?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.44,0:02:38.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I have no further use for this prison.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.44,0:02:46.12,Default,,0,0,0,,The child that was born is\Nalready in my possession.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.38,0:02:56.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I simply have to wait for\Nmy faded time to go to heaven.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.00,0:03:31.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, all right, all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.40,0:03:40.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't wanna fade, let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.70,0:03:44.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Come and find a way.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.22,0:03:45.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I want me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.62,0:03:48.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I want you to be me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.40,0:03:58.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Break out,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.12,0:04:48.36,Default,,0,0,0,,This is really bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.94,0:04:49.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Like a nightmare.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.68,0:04:53.38,Default,,0,0,0,,They've issued a maximum\Nclass security alert.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.46,0:04:55.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone here is armed to the teeth.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.26,0:04:57.24,Default,,0,0,0,,And the whole place is\Ncrawling with guards.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.32,0:04:59.79,Default,,0,0,0,,I shouldn't even stay here another minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.80,0:05:01.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Jolene!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.02,0:05:03.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Can you hear me at all?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.20,0:05:04.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you listening?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.20,0:05:06.49,Default,,0,0,0,,The priest is no longer on this island.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.70,0:05:10.04,Default,,0,0,0,,He's already left the Green Dolphin\NStreet prison for who knows what.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.12,0:05:11.76,Default,,0,0,0,,But he didn't have any belongings,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.84,0:05:15.55,Default,,0,0,0,,and I confirmed that he wasn't\Ncarrying a baby anywhere on him.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.52,0:05:19.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I've been so bored. I\Ngave myself a belly ring.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.28,0:05:23.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Anyway, did you bring the disc with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.00,0:05:25.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Emporio, do you have it now?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.60,0:05:29.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you contact the Speedwagon Foundation?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.32,0:05:31.66,Default,,0,0,0,,No way I could with such tight security.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.74,0:05:33.92,Default,,0,0,0,,But of course I have the disc, Jolene.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.00,0:05:36.71,Default,,0,0,0,,I would never leave it\Nlying around somewhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.66,0:05:41.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, I'm breaking out.\NLead the way. Jolene,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.36,0:05:42.42,Default,,0,0,0,,according to the guards,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.50,0:05:43.80,Default,,0,0,0,,they think that you're the only one who
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.88,0:05:46.14,Default,,0,0,0,,survived what happened\Nin the Punishment Ward.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.22,0:05:47.62,Default,,0,0,0,,They can't accuse you yet,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.70,0:05:51.08,Default,,0,0,0,,but at the moment you're the only\Nperson they can question about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.16,0:05:53.63,Default,,0,0,0,,And this area is the most heavily guarded.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.30,0:05:56.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you saying you want\Nto escape to my room?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.68,0:05:58.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't think you get it, Emporio.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.80,0:06:00.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm talking about the prison.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.42,0:06:02.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm breaking out of this place.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.12,0:06:04.53,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't sit around here and wait anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.04,0:06:05.88,Default,,0,0,0,,It's time.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.12,0:06:08.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm getting off of Green Dolphin Island.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.28,0:06:09.93,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll show me the shortcut.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.94,0:06:14.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll definitely call the Speedwagon\NFoundation for you, Jolene.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.46,0:06:17.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll try my best to get\Na hold of them today.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.08,0:06:19.20,Default,,0,0,0,,You're missing the big picture, Emporio.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.28,0:06:21.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Getting Dad's disc back\Nwas the first step.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.56,0:06:24.30,Default,,0,0,0,,But just because we have it\Nnow doesn't mean this is over.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.38,0:06:28.50,Default,,0,0,0,,If FF was still with us, they'd\Nalready be hot on that priest's trail.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.92,0:06:31.92,Default,,0,0,0,,And now that I've finally\Nread my father's memories,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.00,0:06:34.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I know what the last 20 years mean!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.86,0:06:39.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Also, I understand why my father decided\Nto seal away Dio's stand ability.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.38,0:06:42.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Fact is, my old man would\Nnever let that priest get away.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.18,0:06:45.00,Default,,0,0,0,,My name is Jolene Keicho.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.24,0:06:48.42,Default,,0,0,0,,It's up to me to seal what\Nthat bastard just obtained.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.08,0:06:56.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Emporio, do you honestly\Nplan to stay here forever?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.74,0:06:58.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Ultimately, you decide.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.44,0:06:59.97,Default,,0,0,0,,But we can leave together.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.22,0:07:01.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't think you're understanding.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.06,0:07:03.35,Default,,0,0,0,,You just don't get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.96,0:07:05.14,Default,,0,0,0,,No, I do get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.62,0:07:09.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Give me three minutes and I can\Ndestroy one of these iron bars.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.50,0:07:10.90,Default,,0,0,0,,But what about after that?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.98,0:07:13.24,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no one else here\Nwho can help you right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.32,0:07:14.15,Default,,0,0,0,,It's only me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.80,0:07:17.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Hermes and Anastasia are still\Nin the medical ward recovering,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.52,0:07:19.23,Default,,0,0,0,,and they'll be there a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.44,0:07:22.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Weather is secluding himself\Nin his cell for some reason,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.10,0:07:23.92,Default,,0,0,0,,and won't even come to my room.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.12,0:07:25.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I have that covered.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.34,0:07:27.46,Default,,0,0,0,,We can go from the Ultra\NSecurity House unit.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.54,0:07:29.70,Default,,0,0,0,,The Marsh is that way. Impossible!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.10,0:07:32.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Nobody has been able to\Nescape this prison, not ever!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.64,0:07:36.86,Default,,0,0,0,,There were inmates who were punished\Nseverely for even contemplating breaking out.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.94,0:07:37.77,Default,,0,0,0,,But anyway,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.12,0:07:39.96,Default,,0,0,0,,unless we can stop time like your dad,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.04,0:07:43.16,Default,,0,0,0,,we're going to be stuck here and there's\Nnothing you or I can do about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.24,0:07:46.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't figure out what, but\Nthere's something more to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.30,0:07:49.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean, something way scarier\Nthan the security cameras.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.42,0:07:52.42,Default,,0,0,0,,It's almost as if the prison\Nitself is watching us.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.84,0:07:56.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Emporium, when is the next new\Nmoon on the calendar? Wait, Jolene!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.12,0:07:59.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's wait for the\NSpeedwagon Foundation first!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.22,0:08:01.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I would hate for us to lose the disk.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.42,0:08:03.88,Default,,0,0,0,,It took so much time\Nand trouble to get back.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.96,0:08:05.66,Default,,0,0,0,,North 28 degrees, 24 minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.74,0:08:08.76,Default,,0,0,0,,West 80 degrees, 36\Nminutes. Where is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.14,0:08:10.97,Default,,0,0,0,,I...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.05,0:08:11.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, Jolene.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.24,0:08:14.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to help you, but I can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.62,0:08:34.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I have a message from Palesnake.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.78,0:08:35.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen carefully.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.66,0:08:38.28,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the end of the line.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.36,0:08:40.95,Default,,0,0,0,,And don't even think\Nabout trying to escape.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.04,0:08:41.92,Default,,0,0,0,,If you comply,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.00,0:08:46.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll make sure no one stops you from getting\Nyour father's disc out of this prison.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.70,0:08:56.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, you've got guts, that's for sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.82,0:08:59.76,Default,,0,0,0,,You came right out and showed\Nme your face and stand.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.84,0:09:01.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Wanna tell me your name?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.74,0:09:02.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm Miu Miu.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.92,0:09:05.50,Default,,0,0,0,,And you can call my stand Jailhouse Lock.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.76,0:09:07.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm showing you as a warning.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.30,0:09:08.59,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd take it seriously.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.00,0:09:10.70,Default,,0,0,0,,So, let me get this straight.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.78,0:09:12.52,Default,,0,0,0,,He told you to finish me off?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.70,0:09:15.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, yes, if you plan on\Nescaping later, that is.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.02,0:09:17.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Escaping later, you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.06,0:09:19.42,Default,,0,0,0,,No, that ain't my plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.56,0:09:21.44,Default,,0,0,0,,This is...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.70,0:09:28.94,Default,,0,0,0,,It's inside the bars.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.36,0:09:32.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm warning you again, Jolene\NKujo, so I know you hear me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.82,0:09:34.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't touch the iron bars.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.72,0:09:38.60,Default,,0,0,0,,The more you think about escaping, the\Ncloser you'll get to a very ugly death.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.68,0:09:39.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Is this your ability?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.74,0:09:41.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Like this!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.68,0:09:49.80,Default,,0,0,0,,You want me to call someone for you?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.82,0:09:56.88,Default,,0,0,0,,What's up, Jolene? You okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.26,0:09:58.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, wait, where am I?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.92,0:09:59.94,Default,,0,0,0,,What is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.34,0:10:01.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, you're Gwess.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.96,0:10:03.42,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the female ward?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.32,0:10:05.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Ouch!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.48,0:10:09.82,Default,,0,0,0,,One, grab a pen immediately.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.40,0:10:12.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.08,0:10:20.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Two, know that you can only retain\Nup to three new things at a time.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.64,0:10:22.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Three, defeat the stand user.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.24,0:10:24.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Her name is Miu Miu.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.64,0:10:28.58,Default,,0,0,0,,What's all this?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.88,0:10:29.98,Default,,0,0,0,,And who wrote it?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.30,0:10:34.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Did they use this pen to write it\Nall down on me while I was sleeping?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.84,0:10:37.40,Default,,0,0,0,,That's it, I remember now.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.82,0:10:40.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I was in solitary because\Nof the security incident.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.98,0:10:44.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I pierced my belly button,\Nand then I saw Emporium.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.42,0:10:48.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I told him that I was going to be\Nescaping so I could go after the priest.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.82,0:10:52.34,Default,,0,0,0,,And then after that, after that.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.42,0:10:57.40,Default,,0,0,0,,i and and after i said i was
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.48,0:11:00.04,Default,,0,0,0,,escaping right somebody showed
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.12,0:11:05.52,Default,,0,0,0,,up but who what i wrote all these
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.60,0:11:10.58,Default,,0,0,0,,this is my handwriting that's\Nimpossible when i have no memory
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.66,0:11:14.88,Default,,0,0,0,,of this hey you why am i suddenly\Nback here at the female ward.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.32,0:11:19.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, answer the question.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.00,0:11:21.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Why the hell are you ignoring me?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.80,0:11:24.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I've been asleep till now,\Nso I honestly don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.40,0:11:25.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm asking you for real.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.60,0:11:27.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, okay. That's better.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.42,0:11:29.83,Default,,0,0,0,,But before that, do you have a pen handy?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.40,0:11:31.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Give me one and hurry up.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.20,0:11:41.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Alright, listen up.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.46,0:11:43.75,Default,,0,0,0,,I swear I'm not joking when I ask this.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.02,0:11:46.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you think I could have\Nwritten these words by myself,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.00,0:11:48.72,Default,,0,0,0,,on my own body, without help?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.82,0:11:50.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Mm-hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.90,0:11:57.28,Default,,0,0,0,,By any chance, Wes,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.72,0:12:02.70,Default,,0,0,0,,have I been asking you the same\Nfew questions over and over again?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.22,0:12:06.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Do me a favor.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.86,0:12:11.86,Default,,0,0,0,,About those questions I keep asking you,\Nwould you mind answering them for me again?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.94,0:12:12.77,Default,,0,0,0,,I
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.85,0:12:19.56,Default,,0,0,0,,don't
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.06,0:12:31.06,Default,,0,0,0,,know.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.94,0:12:45.56,Default,,0,0,0,,To the female wing, as\Nof two days ago, for real
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.64,0:12:48.68,Default,,0,0,0,,i've been back here for\Ntwo days yeah and i hope
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.76,0:12:52.92,Default,,0,0,0,,you feel better soon\Nyou'll need it two days i
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.00,0:12:55.77,Default,,0,0,0,,was asking the same\Nquestions for two damn days
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.34,0:13:01.86,Default,,0,0,0,,but why would i defeat\Nthe stand user her name is
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.94,0:13:07.98,Default,,0,0,0,,mew mew wait holy crap\Ncould it be no no way it's a
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.06,0:13:10.70,Default,,0,0,0,,stand attack to prevent me\Nfrom breaking out of this
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.78,0:13:13.66,Default,,0,0,0,,hellhole and i'm being\Nattacked right this moment
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.36,0:13:16.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Everything up to Empress visit
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.70,0:13:18.34,Default,,0,0,0,,but after that um
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.66,0:13:24.90,Default,,0,0,0,,after that after that i i'm sure i\Nmust have i think something happened
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.36,0:13:39.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh no, there's more of this shit?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.04,0:13:41.10,Default,,0,0,0,,What is all this?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.08,0:13:46.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Incidentally, Gwess, you know\Nsomeone who goes by the name Mew Mew?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.82,0:13:49.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Leaky there, Jolene, you\Ncan ask new questions.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.70,0:13:51.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, she's from the floor above.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.32,0:13:54.14,Default,,0,0,0,,If I'm right, she's a bleach\Nblonde, bad split ends.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.22,0:13:55.44,Default,,0,0,0,,About your height, I'd say.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.52,0:13:58.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know what shit she pulled to\Nget locked up, but I bet it was major.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.06,0:14:00.88,Default,,0,0,0,,At any rate, the woman's trash.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.40,0:14:02.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.31,0:14:03.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Where can I go find her now?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.04,0:14:05.98,Default,,0,0,0,,If you'd been looking,\Nyou would have seen her.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.06,0:14:08.59,Default,,0,0,0,,She just walked past\Nthe door a second ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.80,0:14:17.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Gwess, tell me one more time.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.68,0:14:18.86,Default,,0,0,0,,What'd she look like?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.94,0:14:21.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd say her height's around\Nfive foot seven and change.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.82,0:14:24.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Blonde hair, bitchy\Nstare, wicked split ends.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.86,0:14:26.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Where's cut out stockings?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.46,0:14:28.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, I'm back here?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.26,0:14:32.03,Default,,0,0,0,,How did I end up back at\Nthe female ward again?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.38,0:14:38.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Who is Miu Miu? Is she...\NIs there a problem, Han?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.16,0:14:39.99,Default,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.26,0:14:42.52,Default,,0,0,0,,You said you were going\Nto go eat just now.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.60,0:14:43.84,Default,,0,0,0,,It's almost time for lunch.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.92,0:14:44.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Good timing.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.83,0:14:45.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, is that so?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.96,0:14:51.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you dare think about\Nescaping Jolene Kujo.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.28,0:14:54.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't care what your plan is.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.42,0:14:58.71,Default,,0,0,0,,You and your friends will never be\Nable to get past Jailhouse Lock or me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.52,0:15:13.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Halesnake's true identity was\Nthe priest, Father Poochie.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.74,0:15:15.57,Default,,0,0,0,,F .F.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.65,0:15:16.85,Default,,0,0,0,,pinned it down for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.56,0:15:20.39,Default,,0,0,0,,And?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.92,0:15:24.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Then they're gone, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.66,0:15:42.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Drink up. You've earned it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.72,0:15:49.84,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll avenge you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.84,0:15:52.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.75,0:15:54.11,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you think you're doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.20,0:15:55.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Meal ticket now!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.68,0:15:56.92,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.00,0:15:58.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm here to get some lunch.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.14,0:15:59.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Then you better show me your lunch ticket.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.92,0:16:03.06,Default,,0,0,0,,You're walking out of here hungry\Nif you try to pull any shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.14,0:16:04.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry up, show me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.42,0:16:05.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't have all day.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.50,0:16:07.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Why don't you just step aside?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.20,0:16:08.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Bye. Get out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.42,0:16:10.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Next.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.48,0:16:15.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Shit, did I forget it\Non my bed in the cell?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.08,0:16:17.49,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd better find a place to write it down.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.22,0:16:27.92,Default,,0,0,0,,What was I doing just now?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.32,0:16:30.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I know I came back to\Nthe cell for something.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.80,0:16:31.63,Default,,0,0,0,,What was it?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.24,0:16:35.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, think.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.82,0:16:40.84,Default,,0,0,0,,It had to be at least important\Nenough to take the trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.92,0:16:41.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Jolyne!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.83,0:16:42.69,Default,,0,0,0,,That's my lunch you're eating!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.78,0:16:43.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Drop that fork now!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.58,0:16:45.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh man, it's almost gone!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.96,0:16:49.00,Default,,0,0,0,,That was my favorite cheese\Npenne and you snarfed it all!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.08,0:16:49.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Dumbass!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.99,0:16:53.11,Default,,0,0,0,,You put your own meal ticket\Nin your pocket this morning!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.10,0:16:57.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.01,0:17:00.69,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll use this to go get you\Na replacement meal then.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.78,0:17:02.19,Default,,0,0,0,,It's fine really, don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.40,0:17:05.88,Default,,0,0,0,,How about you just give me your meal\Nticket and I'll go get it myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.96,0:17:06.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.22,0:17:09.50,Default,,0,0,0,,And maybe you should write\Nit down somewhere this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.58,0:17:13.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I gave my meal ticket to Guaz.\NI didn't lose it. My bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.44,0:17:21.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Who's this? A user?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.46,0:17:23.64,Default,,0,0,0,,That can only mean that it's a stand.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.46,0:17:25.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, that's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.64,0:17:27.17,Default,,0,0,0,,I have to go find Emporio.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.58,0:17:30.29,Default,,0,0,0,,I was trying to escape\Nfrom the isolated cell.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.94,0:17:33.42,Default,,0,0,0,,And I was probably with\NEmporio at the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.50,0:17:35.15,Default,,0,0,0,,That's the only explanation.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.70,0:17:38.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I bet he knows something\Nabout it that can help me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.54,0:17:40.08,Default,,0,0,0,,He knows I want to escape.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.46,0:17:43.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, we have a big problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.52,0:17:45.08,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no more mustard in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.16,0:17:46.02,Default,,0,0,0,,It's empty!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.30,0:17:47.64,Default,,0,0,0,,How about a new one?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.54,0:17:51.37,Default,,0,0,0,,This again?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.68,0:17:54.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Do they serve the same\Ncrap every day here?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.86,0:17:56.57,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not even all that hungry.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.72,0:17:58.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll just eat the cheese\Npenny, that's good.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.92,0:18:00.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey Jolene, mind if I sit down?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.74,0:18:10.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll take that as a yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.86,0:18:13.27,Default,,0,0,0,,I stepped on a fucking cockroach earlier.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.72,0:18:15.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Now there's dead bug on my shoes
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.26,0:18:18.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Who is this woman? So weird?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.22,0:18:24.92,Default,,0,0,0,,She obviously knows who I am tall\Nblonde split ends cut out stockings
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.00,0:18:28.02,Default,,0,0,0,,You asshole?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.10,0:18:29.52,Default,,0,0,0,,The hell are you doing to my lunch?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.60,0:18:31.01,Default,,0,0,0,,This needs some mustard!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.14,0:18:34.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe a little ketchup to?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.36,0:18:39.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Dressing would be the perfect touch!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.56,0:18:49.44,Default,,0,0,0,,That's delicious!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.52,0:18:51.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks a lot!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.58,0:18:55.12,Default,,0,0,0,,You look so familiar! What's your name?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.20,0:18:56.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh no!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.11,0:18:57.49,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm so sorry! Jolene!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.58,0:18:58.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Look what a mess I've made!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.90,0:19:00.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Please let me clean it up!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.18,0:19:01.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.09,0:19:01.92,Default,,0,0,0,,It got all over your arm too!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.01,0:19:02.90,Default,,0,0,0,,It's really dirty!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.98,0:19:04.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm just gonna wipe away all that grunge!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.92,0:19:05.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Scrubby!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.83,0:19:06.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Scrub!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.75,0:19:09.08,Default,,0,0,0,,There we go! All cleaned! Stand up!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.24,0:19:10.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Isn't that better now?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.60,0:19:12.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me see inside that pocket, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.24,0:19:19.71,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll just leave that for you to look over.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.86,0:19:21.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Jailhouse lock.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.32,0:19:24.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Anyone who, while trying to escape,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.28,0:19:28.80,Default,,0,0,0,,touches the bars my stands in will only be\Nable to remember three things at a time,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.88,0:19:29.71,Default,,0,0,0,,sadly.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.94,0:19:31.98,Default,,0,0,0,,A life of threes appears simple,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.22,0:19:36.10,Default,,0,0,0,,but it's actually more difficult\Nthan losing all of your memories.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.44,0:19:38.22,Default,,0,0,0,,You will continuously repeat,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.70,0:19:41.90,Default,,0,0,0,,experience, and be painfully reminded\Nthat everything you do is useless.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.98,0:19:45.38,Default,,0,0,0,,An arduous feedback loop that\Nslowly erodes your spirit.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.58,0:19:49.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Eventually, it'll even\Ndrain your will to escape.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.00,0:19:52.20,Default,,0,0,0,,It might feel something like paralysis,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.28,0:19:57.05,Default,,0,0,0,,but really, that's your appropriate\Npunishment for trying to break out of prison.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.92,0:20:02.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I know I need something, but what?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.26,0:20:04.09,Default,,0,0,0,,What's important?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.17,0:20:06.06,Default,,0,0,0,,What's something I cannot forget?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.88,0:20:09.50,Default,,0,0,0,,What do I need to break\Nthrough this situation?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.58,0:20:10.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Just one thing!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.08,0:20:12.26,Default,,0,0,0,,That's all I need!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.74,0:20:14.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I gotta remember it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.64,0:20:17.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Cause if I can't do that\Nnow, I'll forget it forever!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.44,0:20:20.02,Default,,0,0,0,,One goddamn thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.44,0:20:22.62,Default,,0,0,0,,But what matters most is...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.52,0:20:31.68,Default,,0,0,0,,This, this is all I need.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.02,0:20:33.73,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll leave room for one more.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.20,0:20:35.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Now it's down to these two.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.98,0:20:38.04,Default,,0,0,0,,These two are the only ones I need.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.28,0:20:40.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I can 86 the rest myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.52,0:20:43.87,Default,,0,0,0,,And get back to my goal of\Nbreaking the fuck out of here!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.68,0:20:48.51,Default,,0,0,0,,I...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.59,0:20:49.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I spilled my water!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.84,0:20:51.02,Default,,0,0,0,,This is really bad!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.46,0:20:54.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm being electrocuted.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.28,0:20:57.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I have to pull the plug before I die.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.24,0:21:00.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Otherwise, I...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.20,0:21:04.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't leave this room through that exit\Nand meet Jolene like I'm supposed to.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.20,0:21:10.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I have something important to tell\NJolene. I gotta go. She needs me.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.64,0:21:13.23,Default,,0,0,0,,No matter what happens,\NI can't forget that.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.86,0:21:16.15,Default,,0,0,0,,I have to get out of this room quickly.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.26,0:21:23.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.34,0:21:24.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I spilled my water.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.58,0:21:28.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I have to pull the plug before I die.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.86,0:21:32.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm being electrocuted.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.40,0:21:39.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Otherwise, I can't leave this room\Nthrough that exit and meet Jolene.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.74,0:21:46.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't be able to see her.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.98,0:21:49.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait a minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.42,0:21:52.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I have to go see Emporio?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.76,0:21:57.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I remember seeing something like that on\NJolene's arm right before I wiped it off.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.32,0:21:59.79,Default,,0,0,0,,I suppose I'll have to confirm it, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.56,0:22:02.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Still, no one's escaping from here.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.36,0:22:03.89,Default,,0,0,0,,it's an airtight fortress.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.36,0:22:35.64,Default,,0,0,0,,My head is filled with hope.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.36,0:22:43.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Of some place other than here.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.36,0:22:50.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Although you think I smile.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.92,0:22:55.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Inside and all the while.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.00,0:23:03.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm wondering about my destiny.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.92,0:23:07.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm thinking
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.94,0:23:13.14,Default,,0,0,0,,about all
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.22,0:23:19.38,Default,,0,0,0,,the things I'd like to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.00,0:23:27.00,Default,,0,0,0,,In my life,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.08,0:23:31.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm a dreamer,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.72,0:23:34.38,Default,,0,0,0,,a distant dreamer,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.46,0:23:38.18,Default,,0,0,0,,dreaming far
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.26,0:23:44.42,Default,,0,0,0,,away from today.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.86,0:23:52.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.38,0:24:21.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
